# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF；Windows 脚本检出为 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# ArkTS 的 .ets 扩展名 GitHub 不认识，显式归到 TypeScript 并强制计入统计
*.ets linguist-language=TypeScript linguist-detectable=true linguist-vendored=false linguist-generated=false linguist-documentation=false

# 二进制：不做行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.psd binary
*.pdf binary
